<title>ECUADOR: SOCCER-COLOMBIA BEAT ECUADOR 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-COLOMBIA BEAT ECUADOR 1-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia beat Ecuador 1-0 (halftime 0-0) in a South American World Cup qualifier on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Faustino Asprilla (72nd)</p>
<p>Attendance: 45,000</p>
